  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan - Strengthening Trafficking in Persons reporting  through International Labour Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment will strengthen the Trafficking in Person (TIP) reporting system in partnership with the Pakistan Federal Investigative Agency (FIA), to help combat trafficking and enhance communication and collaboration among relevant authorities. This activity is being delivered by the International Labour Organisation (ILO) and will cover the financial year 2024-25.</narrative>
